  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "林徽因爬上佛光寺梁上找到了什么？如果林徽因活在，今天我猜他第一件事就是把网上那些情感八卦全部举报了。因为几十年来，太多人只盯着他跟徐志摩金月林的关系，却不知道他当年干过一件更疯狂的事，爬到一座千年古殿的房梁上。在蝙蝠和臭虫堆里找个找一行字。林徽因出生在杭州祖父林孝荀是当地有名望的读书人，他的名字出自诗经里的大四司徽，因则百思难。他从小跟着祖母游氏生活，尤氏喜欢读书，精通书法，还特别接纳新思想。家里请的私塾先生不光教私塾、书、五经，还有天文地理，甚至请了外文老师教英语、日语，这在当时是非常罕见的启蒙，但林徽因的童年并不只有书香，他的母亲何雪原是个目不识丁的传统女人，嫁到邻家后跟婆婆由事处不来，又接连失去两个孩子。后来，林昌明纳了妾，母亲彻底被冷落。林徽因从小夹在中间，他爱开明的父亲，又心疼孤寂的母亲，他恨母亲不争气，又无法改变他的命运。这种撕裂感让林徽因很早就明白，女人不能只活成母亲那样。一九二零年，林长明做了一个改变，林徽因一生的决定，带十六岁的女儿去欧洲。他在信里写的很清楚，一是让你多看看世界，增长见识。二是让你了解我的理想抱负。三是让你暂时离开家庭琐事，开阔眼界，养成将来改良社会的见解和能力。这封信几乎就是林徽因一生的注脚。在欧洲，林徽因看到了更大的世界，他站上轮船甲板。看着父亲对赴法勤工俭学的青年演讲，突然发现世界不再只是高高的墙和四方的天，他开始疯狂吸收新知识。在伦敦的社交场合，他接触的几乎是当时东西方最前沿的思想和人物。也就是在那段时间，他找到了自己愿意奋斗一生的事业。建筑学可真正让他咬牙坚持的是，这条路远比想象中难走。一九二四年，他和梁思成一起去美国宾夕法尼亚大学留学，他想读建筑系。但那个年代，滨大建筑系根本不招女生。林徽因没有放弃，他先进入美术系，然后旁听建筑系。所有专业课不到两年，他就修完了建筑系的主要课程，还受聘担任建筑设计教师助理，后来甚至成了这门课的辅导教师。这在一个不招收女生的院系里，几乎是不可想象的。一九二八年回国后，他和梁思成一起创办了东北大学建筑系。那是中国大学里最早系统建立的建筑学系之一。林徽因前后教过四十多名学生，其中不少人后来成为建筑界的中坚力量，但真正让林徽因燃烧的是古建筑考察。上世纪三十年代，中国的古建筑研究几乎一片空白，日本人甚至扬言要看唐代木构建筑，只能去日本。耐良所是林徽因和梁思成不信邪，他们带着考察队走遍了六七个省份，在荒山野岭里攀爬古建，在破庙残园里测绘记录。一九三七年初夏，他们来到五台山侧路崎岖，连骡子都不肯走。一群人盘山两天几乎绝望时，在黄昏中看到了远处夕阳下的佛光寺。林徽因不顾危险，爬到高悬的大殿梁上，那里挤满了成百上千年的灰尘、臭虫和蝙蝠。但他毫不在意，一点一点寻找，终于在梁底下找到了一行依稀可辨的题字。经过一周辨认，他们确认这座大殿建于唐大中十一年，也就是公元八百五十七年，这是中国现存最重要的唐代木构建筑之一。从此，中国人再也不用跑到日本去看唐代木构了。新中国成立后，林徽因又拖着病体参与了国徽和人民英雄纪念碑的设计。很多人不知道，那个庄严的国徽里有林徽因无数次渴血后修改的痕迹。他的才华从从来不只是写诗，他的身份也从来不只是梁思成的妻子，他是一个把生命献给中国建筑的人，那些被后人津津乐道的绯闻，和他真正的事业比起来，实在太过轻飘。如果你也被林徽因的专业精神打，都点个赞，关注我，收藏这条视频，评论区告诉我，你以前是不是也只看过他的八卦？",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 3690,
      "text": "林徽因爬上佛光寺梁上找到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4150,
      "end_ms": 5510,
      "text": "如果林徽因活在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5510,
      "end_ms": 12530,
      "text": "今天我猜他第一件事就是把网上那些情感八卦全部举报了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12550,
      "end_ms": 13770,
      "text": "因为几十年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14130,
      "end_ms": 18670,
      "text": "太多人只盯着他跟徐志摩金月林的关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00006",
      "start_ms": 19190,
      "end_ms": 23350,
      "text": "却不知道他当年干过一件更疯狂的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00007",
      "start_ms": 23810,
      "end_ms": 26510,
      "text": "爬到一座千年古殿的房梁上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00008",
      "start_ms": 27050,
      "end_ms": 30880,
      "text": "在蝙蝠和臭虫堆里找个找一行字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00009",
      "start_ms": 32100,
      "end_ms": 39020,
      "text": "林徽因出生在杭州祖父林孝荀是当地有名望的读书人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00010",
      "start_ms": 39800,
      "end_ms": 44360,
      "text": "他的名字出自诗经里的大四司徽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00011",
      "start_ms": 44360,
      "end_ms": 46220,
      "text": "因则百思难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00012",
      "start_ms": 47220,
      "end_ms": 49680,
      "text": "他从小跟着祖母游氏生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00013",
      "start_ms": 50580,
      "end_ms": 52140,
      "text": "尤氏喜欢读书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00014",
      "start_ms": 52340,
      "end_ms": 53280,
      "text": "精通书法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00015",
      "start_ms": 53740,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "还特别接纳新思想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00016",
      "start_ms": 56760,
      "end_ms": 60675,
      "text": "家里请的私塾先生不光教私塾、书、五经，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00017",
      "start_ms": 60980,
      "end_ms": 62395,
      "text": "还有天文地理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00018",
      "start_ms": 62930,
      "end_ms": 66800,
      "text": "甚至请了外文老师教英语、日语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00019",
      "start_ms": 68340,
      "end_ms": 72155,
      "text": "这在当时是非常罕见的启蒙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00020",
      "start_ms": 73230,
      "end_ms": 76525,
      "text": "但林徽因的童年并不只有书香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00021",
      "start_ms": 77420,
      "end_ms": 81535,
      "text": "他的母亲何雪原是个目不识丁的传统女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00022",
      "start_ms": 82260,
      "end_ms": 85505,
      "text": "嫁到邻家后跟婆婆由事处不来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00023",
      "start_ms": 86110,
      "end_ms": 88245,
      "text": "又接连失去两个孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00024",
      "start_ms": 88800,
      "end_ms": 89280,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00025",
      "start_ms": 89500,
      "end_ms": 90955,
      "text": "林昌明纳了妾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00026",
      "start_ms": 91460,
      "end_ms": 93325,
      "text": "母亲彻底被冷落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00027",
      "start_ms": 93970,
      "end_ms": 96050,
      "text": "林徽因从小夹在中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00028",
      "start_ms": 96170,
      "end_ms": 97650,
      "text": "他爱开明的父亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00029",
      "start_ms": 97950,
      "end_ms": 100175,
      "text": "又心疼孤寂的母亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00030",
      "start_ms": 100750,
      "end_ms": 102445,
      "text": "他恨母亲不争气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00031",
      "start_ms": 102800,
      "end_ms": 104605,
      "text": "又无法改变他的命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00032",
      "start_ms": 105650,
      "end_ms": 109215,
      "text": "这种撕裂感让林徽因很早就明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00033",
      "start_ms": 109620,
      "end_ms": 112125,
      "text": "女人不能只活成母亲那样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00034",
      "start_ms": 112710,
      "end_ms": 113945,
      "text": "一九二零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00035",
      "start_ms": 115190,
      "end_ms": 117050,
      "text": "林长明做了一个改变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00036",
      "start_ms": 117090,
      "end_ms": 119045,
      "text": "林徽因一生的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00037",
      "start_ms": 119840,
      "end_ms": 122120,
      "text": "带十六岁的女儿去欧洲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00038",
      "start_ms": 122960,
      "end_ms": 124820,
      "text": "他在信里写的很清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00039",
      "start_ms": 125240,
      "end_ms": 127020,
      "text": "一是让你多看看世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00040",
      "start_ms": 127599,
      "end_ms": 128940,
      "text": "增长见识。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00041",
      "start_ms": 129960,
      "end_ms": 133380,
      "text": "二是让你了解我的理想抱负。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00042",
      "start_ms": 134280,
      "end_ms": 138160,
      "text": "三是让你暂时离开家庭琐事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00043",
      "start_ms": 138340,
      "end_ms": 139600,
      "text": "开阔眼界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00044",
      "start_ms": 140040,
      "end_ms": 143660,
      "text": "养成将来改良社会的见解和能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00045",
      "start_ms": 144580,
      "end_ms": 149175,
      "text": "这封信几乎就是林徽因一生的注脚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00046",
      "start_ms": 150000,
      "end_ms": 150740,
      "text": "在欧洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00047",
      "start_ms": 151340,
      "end_ms": 153600,
      "text": "林徽因看到了更大的世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00048",
      "start_ms": 154200,
      "end_ms": 156000,
      "text": "他站上轮船甲板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00049",
      "start_ms": 156300,
      "end_ms": 161020,
      "text": "看着父亲对赴法勤工俭学的青年演讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00050",
      "start_ms": 161640,
      "end_ms": 166580,
      "text": "突然发现世界不再只是高高的墙和四方的天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00051",
      "start_ms": 167500,
      "end_ms": 169940,
      "text": "他开始疯狂吸收新知识。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00052",
      "start_ms": 170480,
      "end_ms": 172500,
      "text": "在伦敦的社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00053",
      "start_ms": 173040,
      "end_ms": 179365,
      "text": "他接触的几乎是当时东西方最前沿的思想和人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00054",
      "start_ms": 179790,
      "end_ms": 181010,
      "text": "也就是在那段时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00055",
      "start_ms": 181090,
      "end_ms": 184030,
      "text": "他找到了自己愿意奋斗一生的事业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00056",
      "start_ms": 184050,
      "end_ms": 189030,
      "text": "建筑学可真正让他咬牙坚持的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00057",
      "start_ms": 189030,
      "end_ms": 191715,
      "text": "这条路远比想象中难走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00058",
      "start_ms": 192510,
      "end_ms": 193545,
      "text": "一九二四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00059",
      "start_ms": 193920,
      "end_ms": 197405,
      "text": "他和梁思成一起去美国宾夕法尼亚大学留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00060",
      "start_ms": 198160,
      "end_ms": 199525,
      "text": "他想读建筑系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00061",
      "start_ms": 199970,
      "end_ms": 201095,
      "text": "但那个年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00062",
      "start_ms": 201380,
      "end_ms": 204455,
      "text": "滨大建筑系根本不招女生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00063",
      "start_ms": 204990,
      "end_ms": 206385,
      "text": "林徽因没有放弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00064",
      "start_ms": 206980,
      "end_ms": 208665,
      "text": "他先进入美术系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00065",
      "start_ms": 209030,
      "end_ms": 210710,
      "text": "然后旁听建筑系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00066",
      "start_ms": 210710,
      "end_ms": 213220,
      "text": "所有专业课不到两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00067",
      "start_ms": 213500,
      "end_ms": 216785,
      "text": "他就修完了建筑系的主要课程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00068",
      "start_ms": 217240,
      "end_ms": 221160,
      "text": "还受聘担任建筑设计教师助理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00069",
      "start_ms": 221160,
      "end_ms": 224465,
      "text": "后来甚至成了这门课的辅导教师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00070",
      "start_ms": 225480,
      "end_ms": 228560,
      "text": "这在一个不招收女生的院系里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00071",
      "start_ms": 228760,
      "end_ms": 230545,
      "text": "几乎是不可想象的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00072",
      "start_ms": 231620,
      "end_ms": 233105,
      "text": "一九二八年回国后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00073",
      "start_ms": 233580,
      "end_ms": 237835,
      "text": "他和梁思成一起创办了东北大学建筑系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00074",
      "start_ms": 238350,
      "end_ms": 243330,
      "text": "那是中国大学里最早系统建立的建筑学系之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00075",
      "start_ms": 244150,
      "end_ms": 247210,
      "text": "林徽因前后教过四十多名学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00076",
      "start_ms": 247930,
      "end_ms": 252090,
      "text": "其中不少人后来成为建筑界的中坚力量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00077",
      "start_ms": 252750,
      "end_ms": 257170,
      "text": "但真正让林徽因燃烧的是古建筑考察。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00078",
      "start_ms": 257190,
      "end_ms": 259530,
      "text": "上世纪三十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00079",
      "start_ms": 259530,
      "end_ms": 263210,
      "text": "中国的古建筑研究几乎一片空白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00080",
      "start_ms": 263210,
      "end_ms": 267310,
      "text": "日本人甚至扬言要看唐代木构建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00081",
      "start_ms": 267330,
      "end_ms": 268770,
      "text": "只能去日本。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00082",
      "start_ms": 268770,
      "end_ms": 272340,
      "text": "耐良所是林徽因和梁思成不信邪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00083",
      "start_ms": 272980,
      "end_ms": 276700,
      "text": "他们带着考察队走遍了六七个省份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00084",
      "start_ms": 277360,
      "end_ms": 279940,
      "text": "在荒山野岭里攀爬古建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00085",
      "start_ms": 280540,
      "end_ms": 283840,
      "text": "在破庙残园里测绘记录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00086",
      "start_ms": 284860,
      "end_ms": 286820,
      "text": "一九三七年初夏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00087",
      "start_ms": 287520,
      "end_ms": 291140,
      "text": "他们来到五台山侧路崎岖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00088",
      "start_ms": 291920,
      "end_ms": 293520,
      "text": "连骡子都不肯走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00089",
      "start_ms": 294400,
      "end_ms": 298320,
      "text": "一群人盘山两天几乎绝望时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00090",
      "start_ms": 298860,
      "end_ms": 303515,
      "text": "在黄昏中看到了远处夕阳下的佛光寺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00091",
      "start_ms": 304450,
      "end_ms": 306350,
      "text": "林徽因不顾危险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00092",
      "start_ms": 306750,
      "end_ms": 309350,
      "text": "爬到高悬的大殿梁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00093",
      "start_ms": 309490,
      "end_ms": 314370,
      "text": "那里挤满了成百上千年的灰尘、臭虫和蝙蝠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00094",
      "start_ms": 315010,
      "end_ms": 316230,
      "text": "但他毫不在意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00095",
      "start_ms": 316690,
      "end_ms": 318090,
      "text": "一点一点寻找，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00096",
      "start_ms": 318450,
      "end_ms": 323350,
      "text": "终于在梁底下找到了一行依稀可辨的题字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00097",
      "start_ms": 323970,
      "end_ms": 325330,
      "text": "经过一周辨认，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00098",
      "start_ms": 325570,
      "end_ms": 330350,
      "text": "他们确认这座大殿建于唐大中十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00099",
      "start_ms": 330750,
      "end_ms": 333585,
      "text": "也就是公元八百五十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00100",
      "start_ms": 334240,
      "end_ms": 339500,
      "text": "这是中国现存最重要的唐代木构建筑之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00101",
      "start_ms": 340140,
      "end_ms": 340700,
      "text": "从此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00102",
      "start_ms": 341060,
      "end_ms": 345000,
      "text": "中国人再也不用跑到日本去看唐代木构了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00103",
      "start_ms": 345540,
      "end_ms": 346920,
      "text": "新中国成立后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00104",
      "start_ms": 347420,
      "end_ms": 353640,
      "text": "林徽因又拖着病体参与了国徽和人民英雄纪念碑的设计。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00105",
      "start_ms": 353840,
      "end_ms": 354900,
      "text": "很多人不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00106",
      "start_ms": 355700,
      "end_ms": 361980,
      "text": "那个庄严的国徽里有林徽因无数次渴血后修改的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00107",
      "start_ms": 362760,
      "end_ms": 365615,
      "text": "他的才华从从来不只是写诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00108",
      "start_ms": 366420,
      "end_ms": 370455,
      "text": "他的身份也从来不只是梁思成的妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00109",
      "start_ms": 371110,
      "end_ms": 374565,
      "text": "他是一个把生命献给中国建筑的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00110",
      "start_ms": 375220,
      "end_ms": 378345,
      "text": "那些被后人津津乐道的绯闻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00111",
      "start_ms": 378840,
      "end_ms": 381085,
      "text": "和他真正的事业比起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00112",
      "start_ms": 381450,
      "end_ms": 383205,
      "text": "实在太过轻飘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00113",
      "start_ms": 383880,
      "end_ms": 386755,
      "text": "如果你也被林徽因的专业精神打，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00114",
      "start_ms": 386940,
      "end_ms": 388385,
      "text": "都点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00115",
      "start_ms": 388610,
      "end_ms": 389155,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00116",
      "start_ms": 389450,
      "end_ms": 390685,
      "text": "收藏这条视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00117",
      "start_ms": 391000,
      "end_ms": 392140,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ffec9edc11440c95_s00118",
      "start_ms": 392160,
      "end_ms": 395245,
      "text": "你以前是不是也只看过他的八卦？"
    }
  ],
